      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Wine & Alcohol",
      "char_file": "맥주_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Widens blood vessels fast,",
        "raising skin temperature",
        "",
        "A flush can hit while",
        "you're still drinking"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Alcohol — the fix",
      "char_file": "맥주_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Avoid it within a few hours",
        "of bedtime, or pace it",
        "with water"
      ]
